# ============================================================
# plan: laco_pumpdown -- rough pumpdown of the LACO chamber
# ============================================================
# The sequence proven on the chamber 2026-09-24, run through rLACO so the host
# owns the controller: pump on, settle (PLC: pump on >= 10 s before the rough
# valve may open), rough valve open, wait for the target, then rough valve
# closed and pump off. Leaves the chamber sealed under rough vacuum.
#
# Needs: Manual mode; vent, fill, foreline and gate valves closed (the PLC
# refuses the rough valve otherwise -- the plan then stops at that step).
# If the plan stops early, rLACO's rShutdown ends the pumping it started.
#
# Typical: 743 -> 3.4 Torr in about 6 min (2026-10-01).

load rLACO
record every 5 s

hvc pump on
hold 15 s
hvc rough open
until chamberP < 5 within 20 min
hvc stop
log pumpdown done: rough valve closed, pump off
